   "description": "The send-retry sublayer. FLAT AT ZERO is the healthy state -- these only move when the transport is failing sends: held = messages parked awaiting re-dispatch, dropped/s = given up after max attempts, backoff avg = the ladder step being waited out. Mixed units (count, /s, ms) on one axis deliberately: this is a diagnostic panel you read when something is wrong, and all three are small numbers."
